  "result": "Perfect! All 46 tests pass. I've added two line management functions:\n\n**`addLine(invoice, { sku, qty })`** \u2014 adds or increases a line on an invoice:\n- If the SKU is new, appends it as a new line\n- If the SKU exists, increases that line's qty\n- Validates qty (positive integer) and SKU (must exist in catalogue)\n- Returns `NOT_DRAFT` error for non-draft invoices\n\n**`removeLine(invoice, sku)`** \u2014 removes a line from an invoice:\n- Returns `LINE_NOT_FOUND` if the SKU isn't on the invoice\n- Returns `NO_LINES` if removing it would leave zero lines\n- Returns `NOT_DRAFT` error for non-draft invoices\n\nBoth functions:\n- Never mutate their input invoice\n- Return `ok(newInvoice)` on success\n- Preserve all invoice properties when creating the new version\n\nThe test suite covers all error paths, edge cases, and integration scenarios.",
